WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.615
Open a multi-prompt agent from Assistants

00:00:05.615 --> 00:00:08.967
Fit the flow to the screen

00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:11.111
Each node does one job; edges connect them

00:00:11.111 --> 00:00:13.405
Click a node's output dot to add a node

00:00:13.405 --> 00:00:18.149
Blocked node types are greyed out

00:00:18.149 --> 00:00:22.935
Agent node: a conversation with its own prompt

00:00:22.935 --> 00:00:25.849
LLM Router: branch on what the caller says

00:00:25.849 --> 00:00:28.303
It can also extract values from the reply

00:00:28.303 --> 00:00:31.614
Collect: capture a PIN by voice or keypad

00:00:31.614 --> 00:00:37.163
Action: call your API in the middle of the call

00:00:37.163 --> 00:00:43.347
Test the request and pick the response keys to store

00:00:43.347 --> 00:00:46.354
Logic Router: branch on data, no question asked

00:00:46.354 --> 00:00:50.776
Speak: a fixed line, with variations per language

00:00:50.776 --> 00:00:54.100
Keypad Menu: press a key to choose a branch

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:59.903
Click empty canvas for Global Settings
